-- Large supports: quantifiers over up to 100,000 values and binomial(3000, q). Both are evaluated
-- with loops that don't grow the stack, so the WebAssembly build gives the same answers as the
-- native one.

#eval forall x in 0..99999, x >= 0
#eval exists x in 0..99999, x == 99999
#eval forall x in 1..50000, x * x > 0 and x <= 50000

-- binomial(3000, 1/2) is symmetric about 1500, and its mean is n · q exactly.
#prob binomial(3000, 1/2) <= 1499
#expect binomial(3000, 1/2)
#prob binomial(3000, 1/1000) >= 1
